steps.change:
The replacement for L245-294 is exactly this code. The `switch (b) { ... }` block must be copied VERBATIM from the original L253-293, including all its original Chinese comments (the listing below omits some of those comments only for brevity; it does not authorize removing them). Only the loop header, the inString branch, the `const b = buf[i];` placement and the trailing `i++` differ:

let i = 0;
while (i < n) {
  if (inString) {
    // 上一 chunk 以反斜杠结尾：本 chunk 首字节被转义，直接跳过
    if (escaped) {
      escaped = false;
      i++;
      continue;
    }
    // 字符串体快速跳过：> 0x5c 的字节既不是 '"'(0x22) 也不是 '\\'(0x5c)
    for (;;) {
      while (i + 3 < n && buf[i] > 0x5c && buf[i + 1] > 0x5c && buf[i + 2] > 0x5c && buf[i + 3] > 0x5c) i += 4;
      if (i >= n) break;
      const sb = buf[i++];
      if (sb > 0x5c) continue;
      if (sb === 0x22 /* " */) {
        inString = false;
        break;
      }
      if (sb === 0x5c /* \ */) {
        if (i < n) i++; // 跳过被转义字节
        else {
          escaped = true; // 转义跨 chunk 边界
          break;
        }
      }
      // 其余 <= 0x5c 的字节（含字符串内裸换行）不改变任何状态
    }
    continue;
  }
  const b = buf[i];
  switch (b) {
    case 0x22: // "
      inString = true;
      lineHasContent = true;
      break;
    case 0x7b: // {
    case 0x5b: // [
      depth++;
      lineHasContent = true;
      break;
    case 0x7d: // }
    case 0x5d: // ]
      if (depth > 0) depth--;
      lineHasContent = true;
      break;
    case 0x0a: // \n —— 行结束
      {
        if (line % interval === 0) checkpoints.push({ line, offset: startOff });
        if (depth === 0 && !inString) {
          if (lineHasContent) {
            recordEndLines.push(line);
            recordEndOffsets.push(chunkBase + i + 1);
          } else {
            sawMultiline = true;
          }
        } else {
          sawMultiline = true;
        }
        line++;
        startOff = chunkBase + i + 1;
        lineHasContent = false;
      }
      break;
    default:
      if (b !== 0x20 && b !== 0x09 && b !== 0x0d) lineHasContent = true;
      break;
  }
  i++;
}

Notes for the executor: (a) the inner variable is named `sb` (not `b`) to avoid shadowing; (b) in the newline case `i` has NOT yet been incremented, so `chunkBase + i + 1` keeps its original meaning; (c) `break` inside the switch exits only the switch, then `i++` runs; (d) `break` inside `for (;;)` exits the string loop and the following `continue` returns to `while (i < n)`, which re-enters the switch with the byte after the closing quote, or exits when the chunk is exhausted; (e) a trailing backslash as the last byte of a chunk sets `escaped = true` with `inString` still true, and the next chunk's first byte is skipped by the `if (escaped)` branch exactly as the old per-byte code did; (f) raw 0x0a inside a string is consumed by the string loop and never reaches the newline case, matching the old `continue`; (g) a string open at EOF leaves `inString === true`, so the existing EOF logic at L303-319 behaves identically; (h) string chunks still go through the unchanged `Buffer.from(raw)`.
